      "value": "Can confirm as well. Fix is on camera set background color to 0,0,0,0 and clearFlags to solid color (instead of skybox).\nBtw duplicate of https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1156-camera-environment-mask-is-broken-no-longer-able-to-capture-transparent-ima",
