  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "New update is out, and i noticed the transparency is now incorrect. The skybox layer, known as sky background, is still visible on camera. Its not turned off. Devs forgot this layer.\nThis is problem for streamers who use always transparency, which is still fine in older version.\nOnly green screen works, but its not best solution if you have green colored avatar.\n\nShould fix asap....",
